{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal BAGLEY is a fan-made, free modification for Portal 2 which plays in an unknown time period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/faa8de59bd4d21f0ae7762141eb1494b.poster.avif?t=1769692647\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/faa8de59bd4d21f0ae7762141eb1494b.webm?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/faa8de59bd4d21f0ae7762141eb1494b.mp4?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An estimated gameplay time of <strong>~04-08 hours</strong>* (May change)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Story with <strong>almost 600</strong>* separate in-game voicelines (May change)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over an hour of custom music with the <strong>free soundtrack</strong> included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge amount of custom assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standalone mod (You do not need Portal 2 installed to play)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to Play (You must own Portal 2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic based puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.poster.avif?t=1769692647\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.webm?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.mp4?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Set in an unknown time period, Portal: BAGLEY tells a new story using new characters including the test subject, you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a test subject who is awakened by a <i>scientist</i> named Bagley. Bagley wants to help you escape the facility... But what will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT THE DEVELOPER<i>S</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the development team is only composed of  <span class=\"bb_strike\">one person</span> two persons, the development is more or less long, so I want to apologize if the game comes out in more or less time. But I prefer to release the game in a long time with an irreproachable development rather than now with a game full of various and varied bugs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420570?t=1769692647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420570?t=1769692647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/11de31c853f907f740e68a31a6f1d1649d4f4694/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769692647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/11de31c853f907f740e68a31a6f1d1649d4f4694/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769692647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surrou