aysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.poster.avif?t=1769692647\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.webm?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/extras/d0a9235949f4077d5dd9c86373e43f29.mp4?t=1769692647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Set in an unknown time period, Portal: BAGLEY tells a new story using new characters including the test subject, you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a test subject who is awakened by a <i>scientist</i> named Bagley. Bagley wants to help you escape the facility... But what will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT THE DEVELOPER<i>S</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the development team is only composed of  <span class=\"bb_strike\">one person</span> two persons, the development is more or less long, so I want to apologize if the game comes out in more or less time. But I prefer to release the game in a long time with an irreproachable development rather than now with a game full of various and varied bugs.</p>","developers":["Adrien Vasseur"],"dlc":[2886170],"fullgame":{"appid":"620","name":"Portal 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420570/4c55f8489d2cec332a3454954d119e5205a060ed/header.jpg?t=1769692647","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Portal BAGLEY uses the Source Engine and the Portal 2 IP \u00a9 VALVE.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Proc